@startuml

title Current Messaging Read Flow

actor Client
participant "ConversationController" as Controller
participant "CurrentUser" as CurrentUser
participant "ConversationService" as Service
database "ConversationRepo" as ConversationRepo
database "E2EE Mailbox/EnvelopeRepo" as DB
database "UserRepo" as UserRepo

== List conversations ==
Client -> Controller: GET /api/conversations/direct\nlimit, offset
Controller -> CurrentUser: require()
CurrentUser --> Controller: authenticated userId
Controller -> Service: listConversations(userId, limit, offset)
Service -> ConversationRepo: find participant conversations\nordered by updatedAt DESC, conversationId ASC
ConversationRepo --> Service: conversations page
loop each conversation
  Service -> UserRepo: find other participant
  UserRepo --> Service: User or absent
end
Service --> Controller: ConversationDto[]
Controller --> Client: 200 OK

== Read E2EE mailbox ==
Client -> Controller: GET /api/e2ee/mailbox\nlimit
Controller -> CurrentUser: require()
CurrentUser --> Controller: authenticated userId + sessionId
Controller -> Service: fetchMailbox(userId, sessionId, limit)
Service -> Service: resolve bound ACTIVE device (empty when unbound)
Service -> DB: undelivered entries for device\nordered by serverTimestamp, messageId
Service --> Controller: E2eeCiphertextItemDto[]
Controller --> Client: 200 OK

== Read E2EE history ==
Client -> Controller: GET /api/e2ee/conversations/{id}/messages\nafterSequence, limit
Controller -> CurrentUser: require()
Controller -> Service: fetchHistory(userId, sessionId, conversationId, afterSequence, limit)
Service -> DB: find conversation, verify participant + ACTIVE device
Service -> DB: durable envelopes for device where sequence > afterSequence\nordered ASC, limited
Service --> Controller: E2eeCiphertextItemDto[]
Controller --> Client: 200 OK

== Acknowledge mailbox ==
Client -> Controller: POST /api/e2ee/mailbox/ack\nmessageIds
Controller -> Service: acknowledge(userId, sessionId, messageIds)
Service -> DB: delete entries scoped to device
Service --> Controller: acknowledged count

note over Controller,Service
Realtime STOMP delivery is a best-effort hint on
/topic/devices/{deviceId}; mailbox, history, and
sync cursors are the delivery truth. Delivery never
acknowledges a mailbox entry.
end note

@enduml
